Codegen limitation: TA functions without IIFE generators fail in arrow bodies (#24)

Parse: ✅
Generate: ❌ (variant_trima → "TA function sum requires IIFE generator implementation")
Compile: ❌ Not reached
Execute: ❌ Not reached

Missing from InlineTAIIFERegistry: sum, valuewhen, atr, swma, supertrend, and any ta.* not registered.
Registered: sma, ema, rma, wma, stdev, highest, lowest, change, linreg, rsi, pivothigh, pivotlow.
crossover/crossunder handled separately by inline_cross_handler.

